# DOOM ported to Flow.
#
# The doomgeneric engine core is fully Flow. Host ABI glue (C fnptr
# call-through, errno, error popup) lives in Flow's runtime; this file
# owns the window, main loop, keyboard edge detection / doomkey
# translation, and framebuffer conversion from the engine's 32-bit XRGB
# to packed RGB8 for gfx_blit_rgb.
#
# Controls:
#   Arrows      turn / move
#   W/A/S/D     move forward/back, strafe
#   X or F      fire
#   Space or E  use (doors, switches)
#   1-7         weapons
#   Tab         automap
#   Esc         menu (quit through the menu, or close the window)
#   Y/N, Enter  menu confirm / cancel
#   F1-F10      help, save, load, quit

